            "text": "{\"model\":\"claude-haiku-5-5\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The conversation history before this point was compacted into the following summary:\\n\\n<summary>\\n## Goal\\n- Get the current weather in Tokyo using get_weather and answer in one short sentence.\\n\\n## Constraints & Preferences\\n- Use the get_weather tool to retrieve the data.\\n- Answer in one short sentence.\\n\\n## Progress\\n### Done\\n- [x] Called get_weather(city=\\\"Tokyo\\\") and received the result.\\n- [x] Delivered the answer: \\\"Tokyo is clear and 25°C with winds at 10 km/h.\\\"\\n\\n### In Progress\\n- [ ] (none)\\n\\n### Blocked\\n- (none)\\n\\n## Key Decisions\\n- **Used get_weather tool**: The user explicitly requested it as the data source for the weather report.\\n\\n## Next Steps\\n1. No further action required unless the user asks for additional weather information or another city.\\n\\n## Critical Context\\n- Tool result: \\\"Tokyo: clear25°C, wind 10 km/h\\\"\\n- Final answer given: \\\"Tokyo is clear and 25°C with winds at 10 km/h.\\\"\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Turn Context (split turn):**\\n\\n## Original Request\\nThe user asked: \\\"Is that warm? One word.\\\" They want a one-word answer about whether something is warm. The referent of \\\"that\\\" is not specified in the conversation shown.\\n\\n## Progress So Far\\n- The user posed a single question requesting a one-word reply.\\n- No assistant response appears in the provided messages.\\n- No work or decisions have been made yet.\\n\\n## Context Needed to Continue\\n- The object or thing \\\"that\\\" refers to is not identified in the visible messages, so the temperature question lacks explicit context.\\n- The user expects a one-word answer format.\\n</summary>\"}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"low\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yes.\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tex